flowchart LR
  SRC["Source\n信号源/用户意图"] --> PROD["Producer\n采集/生成"]
  PROD --> SER["Serialize\n编码/封装"]
  SER --> CH["Channel\n会话/主题"]
  CH --> TR["Transport\nSPI/以太网/共享内存"]
  TR --> RT["Router\n服务发现/分发"]
  RT --> CON["Consumer\n缓存/业务逻辑"]
  CON --> RES["User Result\n显示/声音/执行"]
  RES -. "ACK/回读/首帧" .-> SRC
